  "description": "This library provides Hangfire job filters and attributes that allow jobs to be conditionally\n\t\t\tdisabled based on application configuration. By leveraging .NET configuration settings, it enables\n\t\t\tadministrators to control the execution of background jobs at runtime, ensuring that specific jobs\n\t\t\tcan be turned off without code changes. The package is designed for .NET 8 and integrates seamlessly\n\t\t\twith Hangfire, making it easy to manage job scheduling and execution policies in enterprise applications.",
